      "text": "I’d choose the Aeroplan economy award via Taipei if arriving earlier matters most: among the shown awards it arrives first and has the shortest elapsed time. The tradeoff is that it has only 1 reported seat for your party of 1, and its CAD taxes quote is higher than the other shown awards. Treat all quotes as scope-unknown, and confirm current availability and pricing before booking.",
